re-auth, partial backfill — needed a recovery path the user could resolve alone."}]]}],"$L1e"]}]]}],"$L1f",null,"$L20"]}],"$L21"]}]}]]}],"$L22"]
1e:["$","div","Offline on a commute",{"className":"border-l-2 border-slate-200 pl-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"heading-4 text-base","children":"Offline on a commute"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-600","children":"Most journaling happens on a phone with poor signal. Entries had to be capturable offline and reconciled later without duplicates."}]]}]
1f:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"heading-3","children":"How we built it"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 space-y-6","children":[["$","div","Typed contract end to end",{"className":"card p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"heading-4 text-base","children":"Typed contract end to end"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-600","children":"One shared schema package drives the database layer, the REST surface and the client types. A category or field change fails at compile time rather than in production."}]]}],["$","div","Queue-backed insight pipeline",{"className":"card p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"heading-4 text-base","children":"Queue-backed insight pipeline"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-600","children":"Categorisation, anomaly detection and LLM summarisation run as idempotent background jobs with retries and dead-letter handling, so a slow model call never blocks a page render."}]]}],["$","div","Offline-first sync layer",{"className":"card p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"heading-4 text-base","children":"Offline-first sync layer"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-600","children":"Client-generated ULIDs plus a last-write-wins reconciliation pass let the PWA queue writes offline and replay them safely on reconnect."}]]}]]}]]}]
